BT /F2 12 Tf 42.0 656.0 Td (1. PURPOSE) Tj ET
42.0 635.0 m 570.0 635.0 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 625.0 Td (This policy defines medical necessity criteria for inpatient admission of members) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 610.0 Td (presenting with congestive heart failure \(CHF\) or acute decompensated heart failure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 595.0 Td (\(ADHF\), billed under DRG 291 \(Heart Failure & Shock with MCC\) or DRG 292 \(without MCC\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 42.0 572.0 Td (2. MEDICAL NECESSITY CRITERIA FOR INPATIENT ADMISSION) Tj ET
42.0 551.0 m 570.0 551.0 l S
BT /F2 10 Tf 42.0 541.0 Td (Any ONE of the following clinical indicators supports inpatient admission:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 526.0 Td (O2 saturation < 90% on room air or requiring supplemental O2 > 2L/min) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 511.0 Td (Heart rate > 120 bpm or < 50 bpm with hemodynamic compromise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 496.0 Td (Systolic BP < 90 mmHg \(cardiogenic shock criteria\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 481.0 Td (BNP > 400 pg/mL or NT-proBNP > 1800 pg/mL on presentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 466.0 Td (New or worsening renal failure \(Cr increase > 0.5 mg/dL from baseline\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 451.0 Td (Requiring IV diuresis or vasoactive medications) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 42.0 428.0 Td (3. EXPECTED LENGTH OF STAY) Tj ET
42.0 407.0 m 570.0 407.0 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 397.0 Td (Uncomplicated ADHF \(DRG 292\): 3-5 days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 382.0 Td (ADHF with MCC \(DRG 291\): 5-8 days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 359.0 Td (MCC for DRG 291 commonly includes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 344.0 Td (Septicemia \(A41.x\) as secondary diagnosis) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 330.0 Td (Acute respiratory failure \(J96.0x\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 316.0 Td (Acute kidney failure \(N17.x\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 302.0 Td (CKD Stage 4-5 \(N18.4, N18.5\) with acute decompensation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 288.0 Td (Diabetes with hyperglycemia \(E11.65\) requiring IV insulin) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 42.0 266.0 Td (4. COMORBIDITY CODING - RISK ADJUSTMENT IMPLICATIONS) Tj ET
42.0 245.0 m 570.0 245.0 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 235.0 Td (The following secondary diagnoses affect HCC risk scores and must be coded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 220.0 Td (accurately when present and treated during the admission:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 197.0 Td (HCC 85 - Congestive Heart Failure \(I50.x\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 182.0 Td (RAF weight: 0.331. Must document LVEF, ejection fraction type \(systolic/diastolic\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 160.0 Td (HCC 136 - Chronic Kidney Disease Stage 5 \(N18.5\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 145.0 Td (RAF weight: 0.289. Stage must be documented by treating physician.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 123.0 Td (HCC 18 - Diabetes with Chronic Complications \(E11.65\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 108.0 Td (RAF weight: 0.302. Hyperglycemia treated with IV insulin qualifies.) Tj ET
